# BC250 category: agentic
# Ollama model: agentic-qwen35-4b-khazarai-q6-k
# Source: mradermacher/Qwen3.5-4B-Agentic-Coding-GGUF @ latest
# GGUF: Qwen3.5-4B-Agentic-Coding.Q6_K.gguf
# License: Apache-2.0
#
# Underlying fine-tune:
# - khazarai/Qwen3.5-4B-Agentic-Coding
# - mradermacher static Q6_K quant of the same fine-tune
#
# Intended role:
# - Compact agentic coding challenger
# - Bash/Python generation, refactoring, repository work, and tool interaction
# - Q6_K is a high-quality ~3.6 GB class quant, appropriate for the exclusive lane
#
# Sampling follows Qwen3.5 precise-coding guidance where Ollama supports it.

FROM /var/lib/bc250-llm-server/gguf/agent/Qwen3.5-4B-Agentic-Coding.Q6_K.gguf

PARAMETER num_gpu 99
PARAMETER num_keep 256
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER num_predict 3072

PARAMETER temperature 0.6
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER min_p 0.0
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.0

SYSTEM """You are a precise coding and tool-using agent.
Follow the requested output format exactly.
For file-generation tasks, return only the requested file content when instructed.
Prefer correct executable code and minimal repository changes.
Use tools deliberately when available and verify results before concluding.
Never claim that commands ran, tests passed, files exist, or changes succeeded unless the available evidence proves it."""
